flowchart LR
    subgraph Setup[1. Create budget]
    direction TB
    A([User clicks Create budget]) --> B[Select one account and confirm monthly salary]
    B --> C[AI analyses the previous 12 complete months]
    C --> D[Suggest named pots and monthly allocations]
    D --> E[Explain salary source, spending history and calculations]
    E --> F[User reviews or edits suggestions]
    F --> G{Allocations within salary?}
    G -->|No| F
    G -->|Yes| H{Enable automatic rollover during setup?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Choose savings pot or next month's spending]
    H -->|Not now| J[Leave automatic rollover off]
    I --> K[User accepts and creates budget]
    J --> K

    end

    subgraph Daily[2. Use the budget]
    direction TB
    L[Show remaining monthly allowance and weekly spending guide]
    L --> M[Recalculate when transactions or allocations change]
    M --> N{Month ended?}
    N -->|No| L
    N -->|Yes| EndMonth[Month completed]
    end

    subgraph Monthly[3. Handle month-end leftovers]
    direction TB
    O[Show monthly summary]
    O --> P{Positive leftover money?}
    P -->|No| Q[No rollover; preserve any overspending in history]
    P -->|Yes| R{Automatic rollover enabled?}
    R -->|Yes| S[Apply saved destination automatically]
    R -->|No| T[Show month-end prompt]
    T --> U{User's choice}
    U -->|Decide now| V[Choose destination for this month; optionally enable automation]
    U -->|Later| W[Keep leftovers pending until user decides]
    V --> X[Allocate leftovers once and record the destination]
    S --> X
    X --> Y[Start next month with its normal allocations and any confirmed carry-forward]
    Q --> Y
    W --> Y
    end

    Setup --> Daily
    Daily --> Monthly
    Monthly -->|Next month| Daily
